#* '''2006''', Ace Collins, ''More Stories Behind the Best-Loved Songs of Christmas'', [http://books.google.com/books?id=AWRr-nXbQDYC&pg=PA64&dq=%22more%7Cmost+seemingly%22&hl=en&ei=c5iITsm4HeyTiAeTuP2GDw&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&resnum=9&sqi=2&ved=0CFIQ6AEwCA#v=onepage&q=%22more%7Cmost%20seemingly%22&f=false page 64]:
#*: He sacrificed nothing, laboring to get even the most '''seemingly''' insignificant element of every record perfect.
